Short:        Word processor for DOCX, ODT, Amiga docs
Uploader:     (We fill this in at upload time)
Author:       Dalsin Limited
Type:         text/edit
Version:      0.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.2.0
Distribution: Aminet

OpenWrite is a word processor for AmigaOS 3.2.

It opens and saves the documents people exchange today, DOCX and ODT, with
their text, styles, lists, tables and pictures, and saves PDF. It opens the
documents written with the Amiga's own word processors (ProWrite, Final
Writer, Wordworth, Final Copy, Excellence!, Kindwords, Textcraft and more),
so old letters and stories come back as editable text.

Its editor is WebCore, the engine inside WebKit, so text is laid out and
drawn with modern fonts. GadTools window, Amiga keys, the clipboard, an
ARexx port and OS 3.2-style icons.

C:OWConvert converts documents from a Shell or a script, on any Amiga.

Needs: AmigaOS 3.2, a 68020 or better with an FPU (68040 or 68060
recommended) and 128 MB of Fast RAM (256 MB recommended). C:OWConvert runs
on any Amiga.

Status: designed, not built; this readme is ready for the first release.

